1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It's Maureen! Hey, Juju!

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
What do you want?

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Sorry for calling so randomly.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Random indeed.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Lunch as ever, huh?

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Wait, did she say-

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Maureen's actually talking to Juju?

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
You outside right now?

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Yes, I'm out shopping with my family.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Look at you out and about.

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Oh, yeah!

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I was at a cosplay event working as a photographer.

13
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,000
There was like-

14
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
So we got a camera.

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Yup.

16
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Also, pretty soon-

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
We're going to do a coffin group cosplay.

18
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Oh, the horror game, right?

19
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Wait!

20
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Are you into the game too?

21
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
No, I don't have any interest in it.

22
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
However, Shinju loves everything horror.

23
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Oh, I gotcha.

24
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Well, we're doing a group cosplay of it next Sunday.

25
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Next Sunday?

26
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Will your cosplay be done in time?

27
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Is Wakana Gojo making it?

28
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Well, I'll actually be using a retail costume this time.

29
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
So, Juju...

30
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
What now?

31
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
With this group cosplay, the thing is...

32
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
We still need two more people for it.

33
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Would you join us-

34
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
No!

35
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Dude, I couldn't even finish my friggin' sentence!

36
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
You know perfectly well that I only cosplay for myself.

37
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
I still have zero intention of getting involved with other cosplayers.

38
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,000
If you need more people, you can find them elsewhere.

39
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Uh-huh.

40
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
She said no.

41
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,000
I knew it.

42
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Why are you happy about it?

43
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Hey, sis!

44
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Thanks for waiting!

45
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Mom said to go and meet up with Dad.

46
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Okay?

47
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Alright.

48
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Were you on the phone?

49
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Yes.

50
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Marin Kitagawa called me.

51
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
What?

52
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Really?

53
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
She wanted me to join her coffin cosplay group.

54
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Oh my gosh!

55
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,000
You do need coffin cosplay!

56
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
That's so cool!

57
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Wow!

58
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,000
I'm so excited!

59
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
I can't wait to see what you come up with!

60
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:09,000
There's Mira, and Rose, and Claire, Emma, Sophia, and Charlotte too!

61
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
You would look so amazing as any one of them!

62
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,000
You guys are probably shooting the dinner scene.

63
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,000
That bird is so incredibly iconic!

64
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Almost forgot!

65
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
The title screen when you beat it!

66
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
There are so many scenes I'd love to see!

67
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
It's a group show, so you'll be in the studio, right?

68
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
I swear not to get in the way!

69
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
But I'd love to come and watch if the others are okay with it!

70
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Oh, I'm so excited about this!

71
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,000
I declined their request.

72
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
When I did it for Blaze, it was for the Black Lily costume and studio fee.

73
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,000
It wasn't bad, but I won't do another group cosplay.

74
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Even if Wakana Gojo is making the costumes, if it's not a magical girl, I...

75
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Oh, right!

76
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
That's my bad.

77
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
I totally misunderstood before.

78
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:59,000
I thought I could see Coffin cosplays.

79
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
I'm so sorry.

80
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,000
I'm so sorry.

81
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Oh...

82
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Hello, Marine Kitagawa.

83
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Hello, Marine Kitagawa.

84
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
Oh, thank you!

85
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Now to me, after a song with this song, would you forget have to go out?

86
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
It's called Imagining Summer.

87
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Oh, I don't need fire.

88
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
But anyway, if I'd be diagnosed in Wakanda, that's not necessary.

89
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Today, it ain't nothing nothing anything morning if it takes you for.

90
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,060
I'll make you sign!

91
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:11,000
秘めた気持ちが色づいてゆく

92
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:18,000
最後は君と紡いでく未来

93
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,000
今はまだ手探りで迷っても

94
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:29,000
頬布で描き出す光

95
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:35,000
目の色の明日が呼んでる

96
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,080
I'm letting you know what you have in touch

97
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,040
I'm lied to you

98
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:41,200
I'm trying to get friends

99
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,860
You know, my friend can go here

100
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,900
Just watch this

101
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:45,600
Tell me this

102
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,660
High-five!

103
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,480
Muhammad

104
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,420
Ugh you...

105
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:05,560
You're gonna join our group cosplay?

106
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,220
I'm cosplaying with Juju.

107
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:11,420
More importantly, I can't believe you really exist.

108
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,300
Well, I do.

109
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:15,560
You're as beautiful and adorable as you are in your pictures.

110
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:18,020
But you don't even touch them up, do you?

111
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,280
You're so cute, I can't stop staring.

112
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,920
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.

113
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:24,160
Shatagawa seems super happy about this.

114
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:26,620
So does Juju's sister.

115
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,200
Hey, Juju.

116
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:31,080
Where's your fit from?

117
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:31,840
I love it.

118
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:34,080
Not sure I could pull it off like you do,

119
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,660
but I crossplay as a hobby.

120
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:39,000
OMG, so cute.

121
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,580
Regina and Hana Tenbo are great.

122
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,340
They'll have stuff in this style.

123
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:44,340
Thanks a lot.

124
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,220
If it'd be all right by you,

125
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,380
could I see the picture as well?

126
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,360
All right, I'm gonna use the bathroom.

127
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,160
Could I scoot by you, Gojo?

128
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:52,680
Sure.

129
00:05:58,260 --> 00:06:00,720
Hey, Juju, how many followers do you have?

130
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:05,060
You have 210,000?

131
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:05,900
Dang!

132
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:08,220
I guess your black lily did go viral.

133
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:11,220
Then again, you always do crazy numbers online.

134
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,200
Those pics were so adorable!

135
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,600
Your expressions looked great.

136
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,220
Your costume did too.

137
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:17,840
Really?

138
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:21,420
Well, I actually had Wakana Gojo make that cosplay.

139
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,240
You made that one, Wakana?

140
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:23,580
Yeah!

141
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:25,840
I love all of your photos, Juju.

142
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,600
Are you working with a pro?

143
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:28,740
No, I'm not.

144
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:29,900
Oh, really?

145
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,440
They look professional.

146
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,900
Though now that I see you in person,

147
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,780
you're as cute as your photos.

148
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,880
But that's not all there is.

149
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:40,820
Whoever's taking your photos really admires you,

150
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,520
and they're aware of all your strengths.

151
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:45,340
They work extra hard to capture all your best angles.

152
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,900
That way you look even cuter.

153
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:49,440
It's obvious to anyone who sees them.

154
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:51,680
That's probably why people love them.

155
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,960
Let me guess.

156
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,440
You're the photographer, Shinju?

157
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:00,500
That's right.

158
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:01,860
She takes every shot.

159
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:02,940
Oh, hi, Juju!

160
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:04,780
Pew, pew, pew!

161
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,360
Oh, that is so cool!

162
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:07,740
Do you go to any events?

163
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:12,520
No, I just enjoy being my big sister's photographer.

164
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,560
It really is fun taking photos, right?

165
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,060
Yeah!

166
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:18,940
Staaaaare...

167
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:23,100
Hey, Shinju.

168
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:23,420
Huh?

169
00:07:24,260 --> 00:07:25,460
So, be Mira.

170
00:07:27,060 --> 00:07:27,400
Huh?

171
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:28,840
What?

172
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:32,180
Are you asking me to cosplay as Mira for your group?

173
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,400
Great idea!

174
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:36,180
You totally kill it as Mira, Shinju.

175
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,400
We only need one more to be a full group.

176
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,220
Help us!

177
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,800
But Mira...

178
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,560
She's... she's the protagonist.

179
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:44,280
What about Gojo?

180
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:46,560
I'd be way too embarrassed.

181
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:47,820
But you should, though.

182
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,280
You've cosplayed before, haven't you?

183
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:51,220
Yes.

184
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,140
But it was only one time.

185
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,360
You don't want to be Mira?

186
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,520
Oh, no!

187
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,400
I love Mira a whole lot.

188
00:07:58,060 --> 00:08:00,560
Thing is, I don't know if I should cosplay her.

189
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:03,520
I think I'd be way too tall to pull it off.

190
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:04,920
Gotcha.

191
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,940
If that's your worry, it's no problem.

192
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,220
Just leave everything to me.

193
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:10,340
That settles it.

194
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,780
Shinju will be Mira.

195
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,320
I'll go as Charlotte.

196
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:14,820
Akira's Sophia.

197
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,300
Amene will be Emma.

198
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:18,240
Marine will be Rose.

199
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,020
And Juju is our Claire.

200
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:21,660
Miyako?

201
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,220
Huh?

202
00:08:22,220 --> 00:08:27,220
I won't personally be cosplaying, but is there anything I can help you out with?

203
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,100
Oh, for sure!

204
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,600
I really want to shoot the dinner scene so there will be a ton of props involved.

205
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,320
Thanks, Gojo!

206
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:33,500
You got it!

207
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,060
I'd love to try making some props.

208
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,960
The question is, what should we have you work on?

209
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:41,840
Though, since you've never played Coffin, I doubt you'd know what props we'd need.

210
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:44,300
If you stop by my place, you can borrow my copy!

211
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,520
Wow, thanks so much.

212
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:47,300
Does the game take long to beat?

213
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,880
Nope, it's super quick.

214
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,000
Just seven hours!

215
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:50,740
Seven?

216
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:53,840
Thank goodness tomorrow is Sunday.

217
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:56,140
Hey, Wakuna?

218
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:56,800
Yeah?

219
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:01,860
When you finish it, would you please tell me what you thought?

220
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:04,520
I'd really love to hear your thoughts.

221
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:07,340
Give me a call, and we can chat about it.

222
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,160
Pretty please?

223
00:09:09,340 --> 00:09:10,380
I can do that.

224
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:12,980
I'd love to hear your thoughts, too.

225
00:09:12,980 --> 00:09:16,240
Cool. We can decide what he's going to make once he finishes the game.

226
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,620
I'm going to the bathroom.

227
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:23,440
Okay.

228
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,240
Going to smoke?

229
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:30,760
Mm-hmm.

230
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:33,920
I'll join you for that.

231
00:09:34,260 --> 00:09:36,300
Okay, I'll take a bathroom break.

232
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:39,200
Once everyone's back, let's wrap up for the day.

233
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:42,380
Since you've still got to go to ACOS, Maureen.

234
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:43,060
Yep.

235
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,560
By the way, Shinju...

236
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,000
Yes?

237
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:50,340
I totally cosplayed Ray Sama from Press Host and performed at our school's cultural fair.

238
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,640
Ray Sama from Press Host?!

239
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,920
Have you been keeping secrets from me, Maureen?

240
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,640
Why didn't you tell me?!

241
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:59,800
Their cosplays hit different, yet you kept this from us!

242
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:01,520
You could save lives with that look!

243
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:03,200
Maureen, the pics!

244
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,500
Show us now!

245
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:05,240
We're begging!

246
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:09,760
The thing is, we couldn't film or take pics at the pageant.

247
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:14,800
I also had zero time to take any selfies because of the time crunch and all the cleaning up we had to do.

248
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:16,520
Suzuka!

249
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:23,300
So, Maureen, for science, which Ray Sama outfit did you do?

250
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:24,520
Don't tell me.

251
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:25,940
Off me!

252
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,400
The bento scene fit!

253
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:35,740
You're referring to the soup, Ray!

254
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,280
Cold of me war that made every girl lose their mind!

255
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:39,780
You're brilliant!

256
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,120
It's perfection!

257
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,460
That's it!

258
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:44,000
You didn't tell you did any of it!

259
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:44,780
You moron!

260
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:47,120
You wonder they saved me!

261
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:47,580
Save me!

262
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,240
Save me!

263
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,240
Save me!

264
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,240
Save me!

265
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,240
Save me!

266
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,240
Save me!

267
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,240
Save me!

268
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,240
Save me!

269
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,240
Save me!

270
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,740
Your family gets it.

271
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:58,220
You're so lucky.

272
00:10:58,220 --> 00:11:00,580
I'd never argue with you on that.

273
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:02,160
Count your blessings.

274
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:04,500
My parents look down on Manga.

275
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:06,740
I live on my own now and it's a dream.

276
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:08,380
They would toss my stuff.

277
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:10,000
Ugh.

278
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,880
That sucks.

279
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,180
A similar thing happened with my ex-girlfriend.

280
00:11:13,180 --> 00:11:15,780
I dumped her and I'm happily flying solo.

281
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:16,860
Good for you.

282
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:19,480
There's more to life than that headache.

283
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,960
Uh.

284
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,360
Oh.

285
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,360
Want a sec?

286
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:34,840
To be honest, I don't smoke.

287
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:37,360
Hm.

288
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,360
What's up with Maureen?

289
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,140
Do you not like her?

290
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:48,280
It's not like you were being subtle.

291
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:51,500
And you've gotten very chatty now that she's not here.

292
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,420
Oh.

293
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:55,880
Wakana.

294
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,580
Think he caught all that?

295
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:04,240
I'm sorry. I just happened to be walking by.

296
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:07,420
Yeah. Don't worry about it.

297
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:17,280
Of course you're concerned. You're her friend.

298
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:27,280
I'm sorry. I can explain.

299
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:49,700
I... I don't want to be her buddy. I don't want to talk to her. I don't want her near me. I just... I can't do it.

300
00:12:52,420 --> 00:12:59,160
I had a feeling they'd choose the dinner scene. And it seems I was correct.

301
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:02,320
I honestly don't think I can go through with this.

302
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,600
This sucks.

303
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,860
Oh! Just in time! Welcome back!

304
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:17,140
