305
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:19,260
So excited! So excited!

306
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:23,420
Uh-huh. Super thrilled. What am I going to do?

307
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:26,800
You ready?

308
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:28,320
You know it!

309
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,940
