333
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:17,540
But I'm cosplaying the edgy one this time.

334
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,280
The precious Sister Rose.

335
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,880
I'm majorly obsessed.

336
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:22,540
She looks cool.

337
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:31,560
I can see why all of you love this game so much.

338
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:34,500
Watching them work and share their meals together,

339
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:37,280
it really feels like you're spending a day in the life of a nun.

340
00:15:38,260 --> 00:15:41,040
They aren't related by blood, but they're family.

341
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:43,000
They always support each other.

342
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:44,880
Though their days are all the same,

343
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:48,200
it's interesting to watch their bonds and love for one another grow.

344
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,980
Huh, it isn't really a horror game.

345
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:54,220
The slice-of-life aspect reminds me a lot of Suck IDK.

346
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:57,280
Jeez, I could play peaceful games like this all day.

347
00:15:58,160 --> 00:16:00,560
Oh yeah, I need to try on my costume.

348
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:01,800
